# Cloudflare static-asset headers (wrangler.jsonc; docs/cloudflare.md). The
# build copies this file to dist/_headers. Headers apply to static assets only:
# the Worker (/api/*) sets its own. `node scripts/check-headers.mjs` checks it
# after `vite build`; `--write` puts index.html's inline hashes in production's
# policy and copies that policy, reporting to Sentry as preview, to every
# other host (*.workers.dev previews, wrangler dev).

# Every path, every host.
